# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — 纯 Java/JAR API 发行物 Conan 打包范式（Maven 源码编译 + JVM 运行环境）═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-27
# Software: jakarta-inject-api 2.0.1（所有 jar-library / 纯 Java API 类包通用）
# Gate: conan create build() / test_package 真机运行
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id:                     E605
title: 上游纯 Java/JAR API 发行物适配范式：Maven 源码编译（禁原 jar 打包）+ 上游无 mvnw 时配方自取 Maven（sha256 校验）+ bishengjdk 17 运行时依赖 + libexec 目录导出 + test_package javac/java 反射断言
trigger_tool: mvn / javac / java
phase: build|package|testing
error_signature: "./mvnw: No such file or directory|Could not resolve dependencies|JAVA_HOME not set"
severity:               2
category:               platform, java, packaging, maven
match_keywords: jar, java, maven, mvnw, bishengjdk, libexec, cpp_info.libdirs, JVM,
  jakarta, api
root_cause: jar-library 类任务存在两个易错点：直接打包官网预编译 jar 违反 L1c
  （必须源码编译）；上游 repo 无 mvnw 时 Maven 依赖不满足，且 OHOS 设备无系统级 JDK，
  需要 bishengjdk 17 运行环境（构建期与 test_package 期都要处理 JAVA_HOME）。
rec_approach: maven-src-compile + self-fetch-maven-sha256 + bishengjdk-autodetect-install + libexec-export
rec_auto_fix:               false
rec_impl:               manual
rec_priority:               1
last_updated:               2026-10-16
authors:               unknown
doc_file:               doc/E605.md
affected_scope:         上游纯 Java/JAR API 发行物适配范式：Maven 源码编译（禁原 jar 打包）+ 上游无 mvnw 时配方
